# clam_shovel: Jon's clam shovel, leaning on the shed's corner (decision
# 61: a shovel, never a gun): a short bark handle with a T grip and a long
# narrow slate blade. The anchor, 0,0, is the blade's tip. 4 wide, 21 tall.
C 0  L 1,-20 3,-20
C 10  L 2,-19 1,-12  L 1,-11 1,-8
C 2  L 0,-7 0,0  L 1,-7 1,-1
C 3  L 0,-6 0,-2
